<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS2.Px1" title="In 5.2.2 Proportional effective rank ‣ 5.2 Analysis ‣ 5 Results and evaluation ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">PER of <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">pico-relora</span>’s weights declines throughout training.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS2.Px2" title="In 5.2.2 Proportional effective rank ‣ 5.2 Analysis ‣ 5 Results and evaluation ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">ReLoRA’s gradient updates are rank deficient.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS3" title="In 5.2 Analysis ‣ 5 Results and evaluation ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2.3 </span>Condition number</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS3.Px1" title="In 5.2.3 Condition number ‣ 5.2 Analysis ‣ 5 Results and evaluation ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">pico-relora</span> has larger CNs in the weight matrices.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS3.Px2" title="In 5.2.3 Condition number ‣ 5.2 Analysis ‣ 5 Results and evaluation ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">pico-relora</span>’s gradient updates are <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">highly ill-conditioned</span> early in training.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS4" title="In 5.2 Analysis ‣ 5 Results and evaluation ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2.4 </span>Findings from PER and CN</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS4.Px1" title="In 5.2.4 Findings from PER and CN ‣ 5.2 Analysis ‣ 5 Results and evaluation ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-0.4pt;"><img src="" class="ltx_graphics ltx_missing ltx_missing_image" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span> Low PER values <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">drag</span> ReLoRA’s performance down.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS4.Px2" title="In 5.2.4 Findings from PER and CN ‣ 5.2 Analysis ‣ 5 Results and evaluation ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-0.4pt;"><img src="" class="ltx_graphics ltx_missing ltx_missing_image" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">pico-relora</span> is considerably more sensitive to fluctuations in inputs.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusions</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS1" title="In 6 Conclusions ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.1 </span>Findings</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS2" title="In 6 Conclusions ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2 </span>Implications</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS2.SSS0.Px1" title="In Limitations ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">(1) Single-run experiments.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In Limitations ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">(2) Limited model scale and diversity.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS2.SSS0.Px3" title="In Limitations ‣ Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">(3) Limited hyperparameter exploration.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
