<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Training infrastructure and runtimes</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Investigating ReLoRA: Effects on the Learning Dynamics of Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Full hyperparameter configurations</span></a>
